step Compute A_brake_emergency
sub Sub-step1
call ConversionModel.Initialize
expect A_ebmax == 1.1785
case Check Kv_int values from National Values (Passenger train)
clause E3 done 3.13.6.2.1.8.1 ; efs 3.13.6.2.1.8.1
clause E3 done 3.13.6.2.1.8 ; efs 3.13.6.2.1.8
